{
  "$comment": "EDE-8 (eDE M0, 2026-11-05): THE APPLY STATE MACHINE of the eUI-on-disk runtime (ede-ui, #EDE-9), what happens between a file landing in ~/.config/ede/ui and the shell drawing it. reduce(state, event) → {state, effects}; pure, no clock, no I/O: the runtime feeds it what the watcher, git and the shell report. STATE: per document name {shown: the commit on screen; commits: the document's history oldest first (the first is its factory commit, f-<name>); pending: {commit, deadline} while a commit waits for the shell's first frame; crashes: shell crashes counted since the document's newest commit; rejected: the issues of the file on disk when it is not what is shown; reverted: true once the newest commit is a revert (the next three crashes go to factory); fromFactory: true while the newest commit holds the factory document (at start and after a `factory` effect), such a document is never a suspect}. Commits are named c1, c2… in the order the reducer makes them. EVENTS (unix ms `at`): `ui.edit` {name, valid, issues?}: the debounced watcher (120 ms, rules.debounceMs) saw the file change and ede-ui validated it (surface.json's rules, then eui-core's reducer); `ui.frame` {name, commit}: the shell presented a frame of that commit; `shell.crash` {}: the shell process died; `tick` {}: time passed (the runtime ticks every 500 ms and on every event). RULES, in this order on every event: (0) EXPIRE: a pending commit whose deadline <= at (rules.frameAckMs = 2000 after the edit) rolls back: effect `revert` {name, from: the pending commit, to: shown, id: a new commit} (git revert as a new commit, so an undo of the rollback is possible), the document shows the reverted content (shown = the new commit, whose content was already proven, so no new pending), crashes 0, reverted true, then effect `reload`. (1) `ui.edit` valid: effect `commit` {name, id} then `reload` {name, commit}; shown is unchanged until the frame; pending = {commit, deadline: at + frameAckMs}; crashes 0; reverted false; rejected null. A second edit while one is pending replaces the pending (the newer commit is what must draw). (2) `ui.edit` invalid: effect `refuse` {name, issues}; rejected = issues; nothing else moves (the last good version stays on screen; nothing is committed). (3) `ui.frame` for the pending commit: shown = commit, pending null (proven). A frame for any other commit is ignored. (4) `shell.crash`: every document whose newest commit is not its factory commit counts one more crash (a factory document is never a suspect; a pending commit also counts); at rules.crashesToRevert = 3: a document not yet reverted gets `revert` {from: newest, to: the commit before it, id} + `reload` and reverted = true, crashes 0; a document already reverted gets `factory` {name, id} (the factory copy committed again) + `reload`, reverted false, crashes 0, and from then on it is no suspect until the next edit. Suspects are processed in name order. (5) `tick`: only rule 0. EFFECTS carry everything the runtime needs: `commit`, `refuse`, `reload`, `revert`, `factory`. The TS reference (src/apply.ts) and ede-ui's Rust port (apps/ede/crates/ede-ui/src/apply.rs) replay every case here.",
  "version": 1,
  "rules": {"debounceMs": 120, "frameAckMs": 2000, "crashesToRevert": 3},
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a valid edit: commit, reload, the frame proves it",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "f-panel", "pending": {"commit": "c1", "deadline": 3000}, "commits": ["f-panel", "c1"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1300, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c1", "pending": null, "crashes": 0, "rejected": null}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a broken edit is refused and the last good version stays",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": false, "issues": [{"path": "#clock", "message": "unknown component Clok"}]}}, "effects": [{"kind": "refuse", "name": "panel", "issues": [{"path": "#clock", "message": "unknown component Clok"}]}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "f-panel", "pending": null, "rejected": [{"path": "#clock", "message": "unknown component Clok"}], "commits": ["f-panel"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 5000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}], "state": {"panel": {"rejected": null, "pending": {"commit": "c1", "deadline": 7000}}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "no frame within 2 s: rolled back to what was shown",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "tick", "at": 2999}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"pending": {"commit": "c1", "deadline": 3000}}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "tick", "at": 3000}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2", "pending": null, "reverted": true, "crashes": 0, "commits": ["f-panel", "c1", "c2"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 3100, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2"}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a late frame arrives with the expiry: the rollback wins",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 3500, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2", "pending": null}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a second edit while the first waits: the newer commit is the one that must draw",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1500, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"pending": {"commit": "c2", "deadline": 3500}, "commits": ["f-panel", "c1", "c2"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1600, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "f-panel", "pending": {"commit": "c2", "deadline": 3500}}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1700, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2", "pending": null}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "three crashes after an edit revert it, three more go to factory",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1100, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c1"}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 2000}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 1}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 3000}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 2}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 4000}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2", "crashes": 0, "reverted": true, "commits": ["f-panel", "c1", "c2"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 5000}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 1}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 6000}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 2}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 7000}, "effects": [{"kind": "factory", "name": "panel", "id": "c3"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c3"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c3", "crashes": 0, "reverted": false, "commits": ["f-panel", "c1", "c2", "c3"]}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 8000}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 0}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a crash while a commit still waits for its frame counts too",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 1200}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 1, "pending": {"commit": "c1", "deadline": 3000}}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 1400}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 2}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 1600}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"shown": "c2", "pending": null, "crashes": 0, "reverted": true}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a new edit resets the crash count and the reverted flag",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {"commits": ["f-panel", "c1"], "shown": "c1", "crashes": 2, "reverted": false}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 0, "reverted": false}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 1100}, "effects": [], "state": {"panel": {"crashes": 1}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "factory documents are never suspects; only the edited one reverts",
      "given": {"documents": {"menu": {}, "panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1100, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 2000}, "effects": [], "state": {"menu": {"crashes": 0}, "panel": {"crashes": 1}}},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 3000}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 4000}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c2"}], "state": {"menu": {"shown": "f-menu", "crashes": 0, "commits": ["f-menu"]}, "panel": {"shown": "c2"}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "two edited documents: the crash counts both, reverts both in name order",
      "given": {"documents": {"menu": {}, "panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "panel", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "panel", "id": "c1"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1050, "data": {"name": "menu", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "commit", "name": "menu", "id": "c2"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "menu", "commit": "c2"}]},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1100, "data": {"name": "panel", "commit": "c1"}}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.frame", "at": 1100, "data": {"name": "menu", "commit": "c2"}}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 2000}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 3000}, "effects": []},
        {"event": {"kind": "shell.crash", "at": 4000}, "effects": [{"kind": "revert", "name": "menu", "from": "c2", "to": "f-menu", "id": "c3"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "menu", "commit": "c3"}, {"kind": "revert", "name": "panel", "from": "c1", "to": "f-panel", "id": "c4"}, {"kind": "reload", "name": "panel", "commit": "c4"}], "state": {"menu": {"shown": "c3", "reverted": true}, "panel": {"shown": "c4", "reverted": true}}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an edit of an unknown document is refused",
      "given": {"documents": {"panel": {}}},
      "steps": [
        {"event": {"kind": "ui.edit", "at": 1000, "data": {"name": "dock", "valid": true}}, "effects": [{"kind": "refuse", "name": "dock", "issues": [{"path": "file", "message": "not a shell document (no factory copy): dock"}]}], "state": {"panel": {"commits": ["f-panel"]}}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
